#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:6057-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-keyboardshortcuts"
msgid "10.4 Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "10.4 Dreceres de teclat"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6059-6
msgid ""
"If you have a device with a keyboard like <b>Kindle 2</b> and <b>Kindle 3</"
"b>, including Bluetooth keyboards and emulators, you can use the keyboard "
"keys, device buttons and shortcuts to control KOReader. <b>Kindle 4</b> is "
"supported too, which lacks a full keyboard but still has enough buttons to "
"make it functional in this context. On these devices, KOReader will enable "
"an extra menu named <span class=\"ui\">Keyboard Shortcuts</span> which you "
"can access here:"
msgstr ""
"Si teniu un dispositiu amb teclat, com el <b>Kindle 2</b> i el <b>Kindle 3</"
"b>, inclosos els teclats Bluetooth i els emuladors, podeu fer servir les "
"tecles del teclat, els botons del dispositiu i les dreceres per controlar "
"KOReader. També s'admet el <b>Kindle 4</b>, que no té un teclat complet però "
"té prou botons perquè sigui funcional en aquest context. En aquests "
"dispositius, KOReader activarà un menú addicional anomenat <span "
"class=\"ui\">Dreceres de teclat</span>, al qual podeu accedir aquí:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:6064-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Navigation / Physical buttons / Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr ""
"MENÚ SUPERIOR / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Navegació / Botons físics / Dreceres de teclat"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6067-6
msgid ""
"This menu is very similar to the <span class=\"ui\">Gesture Manager</span> "
"interface. In this menu:"
msgstr ""
"Aquest menú és molt semblant a la interfície de <span "
"class=\"ui\">Configuració de gestos</span>. En aquest menú:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:6070-7
msgid "You can see the shortcuts that are available on your device"
msgstr "Podeu veure les dreceres disponibles al dispositiu"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:6071-7
msgid "You can see the predefined actions for some shortcuts"
msgstr "Podeu veure les accions predefinides d'algunes dreceres"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:6072-7
msgid "You can assign actions to the available shortcuts"
msgstr "Podeu assignar accions a les dreceres disponibles"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6075-6
msgid ""
"All of the actions in the <span class=\"ui\">Gesture Manager</span> is also "
"available for keyboard shortcut assignment. Which means you can control "
"nearly all the functions of KOReader with these shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"Totes les accions de la <span class=\"ui\">Configuració de gestos</span> "
"també es poden assignar a dreceres de teclat. Això vol dir que podeu "
"controlar gairebé totes les funcions de KOReader amb aquestes dreceres."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:6078-6
msgid ""
"In the table below, you can see the default key and shortcut assignments:"
msgstr ""
"A la taula següent podeu veure les assignacions de tecles i dreceres per "
"defecte:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:6080-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> "
"Universal <span class=\"ui\">screenshot</span> key is <b>Alt + Shift + G</"
"b>. It is available on all screens, modes and platforms. On Kindle 4, it is "
"<b>Keyboard + Menu</b>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"label_blue\">INFO</span> La tecla universal de <span "
"class=\"ui\">captura de pantalla</span> és <b>Alt + Shift + G</b>. Està "
"disponible a totes les pantalles, modes i plataformes. Al Kindle 4, és "
"<b>Keyboard + Menu</b>."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:6084-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> If "
"you have a Kindle 4, <b>SHIFT</b> key in the table below is mapped to your "
"<b>KEYBOARD</b> button. So <b>Shift + (UP/DOWN/LEFT/RIGHT)</b> shortcuts are "
"mapped to <b>Keyboard button + (UP/DOWN/LEFT/RIGHT)</b> on your Kindle 4."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"label_blue\">INFO</span> Si teniu un Kindle 4, la tecla "
"<b>SHIFT</b> de la taula següent correspon al botó <b>KEYBOARD</b>. Per "
"tant, les dreceres <b>Shift + (UP/DOWN/LEFT/RIGHT)</b> corresponen a <b>botó "
"Keyboard + (UP/DOWN/LEFT/RIGHT)</b> al Kindle 4."

